Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.86,0:00:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cass 你在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, are you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.40,0:00:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sammy受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy's hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.95,0:00:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,伤得很严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's hurt pretty bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.37,0:00:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你以为生你气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you think that I'm pissed at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.57,0:00:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cass 我们可以谈谈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, can we talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.12,0:00:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.49,0:00:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不在乎天使坠落\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't care that the angels' fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.33,0:00:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 不管你做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So whatever you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.70,0:00:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道他要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know he was gonna cast.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.89,0:00:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,把天使清出天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}The angels out of heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.19,0:00:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Matatron 是上帝的书记员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metatron, he's the scribe of the God.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.20,0:00:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本就没有试炼\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were never trials.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.22,0:00:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是一个咒语而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.42,0:00:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他拿走了我的荣光\N{\fnArial\fs30}He took my grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.39,0:00:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是凡人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I am human.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.81,0:00:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,都没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.64,0:00:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会解决的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, we'll work it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.23,0:00:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是预言石板\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.03,0:00:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只需要翻译就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now translate.It's what you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.68,0:00:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kevin 你是上主的先知\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin, you are a prophet of the Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.50,0:00:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 我需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please man.I need you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.23,0:00:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果天使来敲门\N{\fnArial\fs30}If angels come a-knocking.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.78,0:00:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们进来就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let them all in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.87,0:00:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beautiful, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.72,0:00:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 Barth\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Barth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.76,0:00:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是Bartholomew\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Bartholomew.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.17,0:00:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们坠落人间的兄弟姐妹们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our fallen brothers and sisters are finding.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.04,0:00:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,找容器的速度都比我们预想的快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vessels faster than we'd even hoped.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.29,0:00:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这条祈祷面向所有\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one goes out to any angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.41,0:00:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,能听到的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}With their ears on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.59,0:00:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.79,0:00:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,先说名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start with a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.48,0:00:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ezekiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ezekiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.21,0:00:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能救你弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a chance I can fix your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.02,0:00:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我治疗Sam的同时也在治疗我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heal Sam while healing myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.49,0:00:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,附身吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A possession.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.19,0:00:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean 我现在一团糟 你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a mess, Dean.You know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.45,0:00:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能让你自己承担一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't let you put this on yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.05,0:01:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会告诉他的 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't do that, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.70,0:01:10.58,Note,0,0,0,0,,（卡瑞伯 怀俄明州）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.83,0:02:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不该来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.45,0:02:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有来这儿的权利 就像你们一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have just as much right to be here as you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.13,0:02:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.47,0:02:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.57,0:02:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,都上来了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.53,0:03:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他好多了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he's better.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.73,0:03:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.54,0:03:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sam的状况已经改善了很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam is much improved.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.00,0:03:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在待不了太久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shouldn't be much longer now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.54,0:03:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 上一周你跟我说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you know.You said the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.66,0:03:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,同样的话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}To me last week, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.50,0:03:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们刚见面的时候我就说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I told you when we met.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.52,0:03:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}This will take time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.99,0:03:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.49,0:03:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就去治他啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go then.Heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.03,0:03:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要我弟弟回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like my brother back, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.07,0:03:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean 我必须说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must say, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.25,0:03:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你们这次的工作不满\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm very uncomfortable with this whole trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.58,0:03:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,调查天使 或者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Investigating crimes involving angels or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.74,0:03:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,调查和天使有关的事 都让Sam和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Involving angels puts me, and therefore Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.10,0:03:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 处于危险 - 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}- At rish - Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.31,0:03:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是家族事业 Zeke\N{\fnArial\fs30}Family business, Zeke.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.64,0:03:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.51,0:03:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we ignore this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.53,0:03:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sam会觉得不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam's gonna think something fishy is going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.21,0:03:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你会小心行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I trust you will be discreet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.69,0:03:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 如果你知道我们去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, if you know where we're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.48,0:03:58.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是说 你又再听我们说话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means you've been listen in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.09,0:03:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 你有没有听到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you…are you hearing everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.48,0:04:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和Sam的所有谈话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Between me and Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.03,0:04:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.46,0:04:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,就只是一两个词\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a word here and there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.85,0:04:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有比偷听更重要的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have better things to do with my time than eavesdrop.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.44,0:04:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如治疗你弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like heal your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.97,0:04:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 你挺好 - 我是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, here's the thing - I mean I was gonna say.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.08,0:04:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面好像\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems like it's getting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.62,0:04:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,太过于平静了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little quiet out there, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.06,0:04:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,天使们没动静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like not a peep from angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.07,0:04:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至Buddy Boyle也蒸发了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even Buddy Boyle goes off the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.38,0:04:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,雇佣人类做天使容器了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And stops recruiting for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.44,0:04:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,很明显 是暴风雨前的宁静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously a calm before storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.53,0:04:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.60,0:04:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.28,0:04:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个路标上写着\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sign said.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.00,0:04:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯林斯堡 50英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fort Collins, fifty miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.09,0:04:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.30,0:04:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我上一次抬头看\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, last time I looked, like.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.79,0:04:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就几秒之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}12 seconds ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.20,0:04:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,距离柯林斯堡还有100英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fort Collins was a hundred miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.00,0:04:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 自从跟那位女神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, man, ever since a goddess.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.02,0:04:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲密接触过后你就这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who got her hooks into you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.01,0:04:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不光是因为Vesta\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's more than Vesta.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.54,0:04:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种事情已经发生好几次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, this kind of thing's been happening to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.38,0:04:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,就好像有大把时间凭空消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like there're chunks of times just missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.20,0:04:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像有时候 我根本不存在一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like there're times that I'm not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.66,0:04:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像是我说过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, like I've said.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.66,0:04:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 那些试炼 我听你说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, the trials, I know, I heard you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.24,0:04:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,上星期你就是这么解释的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard you when you said it the last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.63,0:05:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有上上星期 上上上星期\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the week before that and the week before that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.19,0:05:01.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.69,0:05:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是因为那些试炼啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because…damn straight the trials.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.75,0:05:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们挖空了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}They wacked you, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.75,0:05:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还没完全恢复过来 明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not in the warp speed yet, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.24,0:05:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你会好起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.14,0:05:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会骗你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would I lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.33,0:05:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们已经有人来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, one of your guys is here already.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.03,0:05:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是我同事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, my colleagues.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.18,0:05:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.21,0:05:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.75,0:05:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cass\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.03,0:06:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来这儿干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.10,0:06:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给我的警徽我还留着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still have that badge you gave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.50,0:06:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.94,0:06:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来这儿干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.85,0:06:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,新闻里播了这些凶杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murders were all over the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.19,0:06:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想 我应该能帮上忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I might be of help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.83,0:06:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 但是Cass\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.69,0:06:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这是跟天使有关的 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know this is an angels situation, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.28,0:06:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 你离开我们不就是因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean you left that night because angels were.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.43,0:06:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天使到处追捕你吗 - 对啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- On your ass - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.30,0:06:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你有了新的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you were living the life, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.50,0:06:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你远离了这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Early retirement.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.41,0:06:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,在便利店里工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Working your way up the gas-n-sip ladder.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.44,0:06:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果天使在互相残杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}If angels are slaughtering one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.44,0:06:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须想尽办法帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to do what I can to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.03,0:06:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们愿意冒的风险\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a risk we should be willing to take.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.23,0:06:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.08,0:06:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.18,0:06:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Cass又回来了 - 认真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cass is back in town - Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.48,0:06:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是 他是不是真那么说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you…did he just say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.25,0:06:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}These angels, they were.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.96,0:06:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,被屠杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Butchered.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.25,0:06:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,手段相当惨烈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Much more violence than was required.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.04,0:06:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定不止一个人干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Definitely more than one killers to pull this off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.51,0:06:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,职业杀手吗 Bartholomew团队吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit squad?Bartholomew's people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.65,0:06:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bartholomew分队是我们知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Bartholomew has a faction we know about.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.05,0:07:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,也可能是一个我们完全不认识的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this could be somebody else entirely we don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.51,0:07:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, whoever it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.68,0:07:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都会找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.16,0:07:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.00,0:07:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是 太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's…great.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.55,0:08:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好 Malachi\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening, Malachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.09,0:08:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.19,0:08:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bartholomew今晚会很忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bartholomew is quite busy tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.33,0:08:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,有那么一大批拥护者\N{\fnArial\fs30}With such a large following.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.83,0:08:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的责任真重大啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the responsibilities are enormous.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.50,0:08:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要求跟最高领导人谈话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I called for a top-level summit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.10,0:08:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,没时间理他的小罗喽\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't deal with hand maidens.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.34,0:08:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会向Bartholomew传达你的想法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll convey your thoughts to Bartholomew.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.07,0:08:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会为他的无礼后悔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll regret the disrespect.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.28,0:08:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟我提无礼 Malachi\N{\fnArial\fs30}You speak of disrespect, Malachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.02,0:08:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,经过前两天的血洗之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After the bloodbath two nights ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.13,0:08:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bartholomew公然攫取力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bartholomew's naked grab for power was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.36,0:08:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本毫无尊重可言\N{\fnArial\fs30}But disrespect.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.75,0:08:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他和我其实都想要同样的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}He and I ultimately want the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.26,0:08:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,从Metatron那里夺回天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only way we can take the heaven back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.81,0:08:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一种方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}From Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.55,0:08:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是联手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is to unite.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.34,0:08:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果Bartholomew想要避免这次你死我活的战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if Bartholomew wants avoid all-out warfare on earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.29,0:09:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他必须亲自跟我谈条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll meet personally with me negotiate terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.11,0:09:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 我忘了早点说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, I should've mentioned earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.41,0:09:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bartholomew让我告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bartholomew said to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.68,0:09:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不跟街头混混谈条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't negotiate with street thugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.90,0:09:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,说完了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we done here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.30,0:09:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,说完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.74,0:09:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好戏刚开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so it begins.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.41,0:09:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,能再呆在一起真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is so good being together again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.30,0:09:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我作为人类的第一杯啤酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it's my first beer as a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.55,0:09:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望我可以 加入你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope it's okay…me joining you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.00,0:09:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why wouldn't it be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.30,0:09:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cass 你确定你要回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Cass, are you sure you're ready to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.64,0:10:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,参与这些事情吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jump back into all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.60,0:10:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看你好像已经\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it seemed to me like.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.97,0:10:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,过上安稳日子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd actually found some peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.40,0:10:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你曾经告诉过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You once told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.60,0:10:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是你选择要做什么 而是命运选择你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't choose what you do, it chooses you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.33,0:10:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能置身事外\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a part of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.06,0:10:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管愿不愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like it or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.16,0:10:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 这样的话 我们必须找出\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, then in that case, we have to figure out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.11,0:10:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在对付谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are we up against.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.11,0:10:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.76,0:10:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有怎么阻止他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how do we stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.77,0:10:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bartholomew想要重置Metatron的咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bartholomew wants to reverse Metatron's spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.29,0:10:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,推测他是想要夺回天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Presumably to retake heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.06,0:10:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦他的拥护者足够庞大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once his following is large enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.75,0:10:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是April说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's according to April.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.10,0:10:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你滚床单的那个死神\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Reaper you banged.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.55,0:10:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 你戳死的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and you stabbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.59,0:10:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,她好性感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, she was hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.91,0:10:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,很性感 也很体贴\N{\fnArial\fs30}So hot…and very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.88,0:10:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直到她开始拷问我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up to the point she started torturing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.97,0:10:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 不是每次艳遇都是完美的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, not every hookup's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.38,0:10:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我再去拿几瓶酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I'm gonna get us another round.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.48,0:10:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,别 我去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, I'll get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.95,0:11:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没做过这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never done this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.11,0:11:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,一杯倒啊 这哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}One beer, he's hammered.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.30,0:11:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.81,0:11:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你说你要怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what are you going to do about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.20,0:11:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于Cass吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}About Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.77,0:11:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就像指示灯 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is a beacon, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.99,0:11:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸引每一个天使从千里外到我们这里来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pulling every angel from miles down on ours heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.53,0:11:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 Zeke 老实交代\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you know what, Zeke.Level with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.09,0:11:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底在害怕什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it that you're so afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.18,0:11:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.88,0:11:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我选择回应你的祈祷 治愈Sam的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I chose to answer your prayers and heal Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.10,0:11:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经选好了立场\N{\fnArial\fs30}I chose sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.53,0:11:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,意味着在某些天使眼里 我是不待见的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means I'm not in good standing with certain angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.24,0:11:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好 你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you know what.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.92,0:11:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cass在任何一个天使眼里 都不待见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass isn't in good standing with any angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.98,0:11:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是现在他出现在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right?But here he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.08,0:11:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,上了贼船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ass on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.27,0:11:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持在前线战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fighting the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.55,0:11:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么就那么特殊呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So tell me what makes you so special.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.98,0:11:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 三瓶啤酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go, three brewskies.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.59,0:11:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去车里拿点东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to get something out of the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.71,0:12:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等你等好久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm really looking forward to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.28,0:12:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.69,0:12:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.50,0:12:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你的真面目\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know who you really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.69,0:12:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正不是Ezekiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it isn't Ezekiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.01,0:12:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我注意到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I um…I noticed you look.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.35,0:12:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次Sam提到我离开的时候 你有些尴尬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of uncomfortable whenever Sam mentions my leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.69,0:12:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不知道是你让我离开的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't he know that you told me to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.86,0:12:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here is the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.05,0:12:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sam通过了那些试炼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, when Sam was doing the trials.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.41,0:12:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了封印地狱 把自己身体搞砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}To seal up hell, it messed him up, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.08,0:12:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,第三个试炼差点弄死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}The third one nearly killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.67,0:12:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我继续让他完成试炼 他就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I'd let him finish, it would have.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.87,0:12:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他状态还是非常糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's still messed up bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.91,0:13:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说那个叫Ezekiel的天使治愈了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said the angel Ezekiel, helped heal him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.69,0:13:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须尽我所能救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I got to do anything I can to get him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.51,0:13:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这意味着我们必须暂时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if that means that we keep our distance from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.24,0:13:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,远离你 那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a little while, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.25,0:13:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.24,0:13:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这样不好 但是我也没得选\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't feel good about it, but I don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.52,0:13:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能帮我们真的太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's great to have your help, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.09,0:13:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们不能一起奋战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, but we just can't work together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.53,0:13:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心吧 我不是来揭穿你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax, I'm not here to out you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.81,0:13:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是好奇为什么选择Ezekiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm curious why Ezekiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.79,0:13:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说他很优秀\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say he is a good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.43,0:13:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个可敬的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}And honorable angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.46,0:13:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说的都不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything they say you are not.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.83,0:13:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂你的意思 Gadriel\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see your point, Gadriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.51,0:13:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于我的那些事情 都不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The stories about me, they are not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.46,0:14:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你 却在数不清的日日夜夜里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet you spent countless thousands of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.17,0:14:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,被困在天堂最阴暗的地牢里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Locked in the heaven's darkest dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.90,0:14:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你藏在一个人类的身体里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now you're hiding in this human.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.62,0:14:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,装作是Ezekiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Posing as Ezekiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.34,0:14:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,悲剧啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tragic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.39,0:14:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有多不忍心囚禁你 你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It broke his heart to lock you away, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.36,0:14:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你曾经是他最信任的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were God's most trusted.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.34,0:14:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他才选择你守护伊甸园\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why he chose you to protect the garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.95,0:14:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你唯一的职责就是不让邪恶入侵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your one task was to keep evil from entering.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.59,0:14:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,阻止其污染他最珍贵的产物 人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}From befouling his cherished creation, mankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.73,0:14:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you failed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.03,0:14:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not my doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.25,0:14:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎么样 大蛇钻进去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, for whatever reason, the serpent entered.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.61,0:14:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,地球被邪恶诅咒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The earth is cursed with evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.15,0:14:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须有人受到责罚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone had to be blamed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.52,0:14:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底想从我这里得到什么 Metatron\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it you want of me, Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.76,0:14:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是做你的朋友而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just to be your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.83,0:14:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,像我们从前一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I go back a long way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.19,0:14:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才是那个放你出来的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was actually the one who freed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.74,0:14:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.15,0:15:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我让所有的天使坠落\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was the one who caused all the angels to fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.60,0:15:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括被囚禁的那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Including the imprisoned ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.60,0:15:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.92,0:15:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,天堂里没有天使 一个都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No angels are in heaven, none at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.16,0:15:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 一开始我还以为我会高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, and you know, at first I thought I would love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.44,0:15:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是那地儿太大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it is a big place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.94,0:15:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一个人在那里太没意思了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My solitude is getting tedious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.00,0:15:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.62,0:15:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.00,0:15:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,新计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plan B.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.64,0:15:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,重建天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rebuild heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.50,0:15:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,像上帝原来想要的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}As the place God had envisioned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.36,0:15:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,仅有几个精心挑选的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only with a handpicked few.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.14,0:15:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要那些腐败官僚 像Bartholomew那样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more anemic functionaries like Bartholomew.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.19,0:15:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有那些呆天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}And no more stupid angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.84,0:15:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以有几个好玩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe some funny ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.90,0:15:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你曾是他最信任的 Gadriel\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were his most trusted, Gadriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.40,0:15:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也想赢回你的荣誉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to take back your reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.68,0:16:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想重新掌管天堂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to reclaim the heaven that was.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.33,0:16:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以联手\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could do this together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.71,0:16:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,有Cass的消息吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any word from Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.19,0:16:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.18,0:16:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们难道不应该担心一下他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're not worried about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.62,0:16:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他这次\N{\fnArial\fs30}That he just.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.65,0:16:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,又一声不吭的自己跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took off like that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.15,0:16:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一般不会单独做这样的事情的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean it's not like he does this kind of stuff alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.70,0:16:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他自己的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what he wanted, honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.41,0:16:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从他变成人类之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man, he's been all over the map.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.69,0:16:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,就一直到处转悠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since he got his wings clipped.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.63,0:16:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.16,0:16:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,讣告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obituaries.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.71,0:16:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那些骑手之一吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That one of the bikers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.77,0:16:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.99,0:16:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个人叫Red Dawg\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name is Red Dawg.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.55,0:16:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.16,0:16:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是你想的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not what you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.10,0:16:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这人是个恋家的好男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, he's a family guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.03,0:16:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,家庭教师协会的带头人 在圣诞派对扮圣诞老人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big in the PTA, he played Santa at Christmas parties.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.02,0:16:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,难不成是某一天他脑子一抽就加入骑行帮了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what, just one day he up and joined a biker gang.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.19,0:16:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他几年前就加入了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he did that years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.83,0:16:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,听这个 这很奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get this, this is weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.48,0:16:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.52,0:16:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些都是受害者 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are all the victims, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.20,0:16:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是一起接受的洗礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were all baptized together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.47,0:16:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,洗礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baptized.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.10,0:16:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 他们是个重生的骑行帮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, they were a born-again biker gang.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.01,0:16:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 这可不是什么寻常事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's not something you hear everyday.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.51,0:16:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.44,0:17:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 把这儿放大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, make that bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.22,0:17:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bolye兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boyle's Boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.38,0:17:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bolye是指牧师Buddy Boyle吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boyle as in reverend Buddy Boyle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.89,0:17:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,听这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.88,0:17:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Red Dawg的妻子说他丈夫是个有信仰的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red Dawg's widow said he was always religious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.83,0:17:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在他去世前一个星期\N{\fnArial\fs30}But a week before he died.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.75,0:17:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他参加了一个教会成员聚会\N{\fnArial\fs30}He came home from a prayer meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.11,0:17:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个人改头换面\N{\fnArial\fs30}And was a changed man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.68,0:17:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,内心充满神圣的荣耀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Filled with divine glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.26,0:17:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说又和Boyle有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Boyle is at it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.93,0:17:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,诱导人们自愿当天使的皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Selling folks on being meatsuits for angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.28,0:17:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,只不过这次听众范围缩小了 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just what talking to a smaller groups now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.11,0:17:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.20,0:17:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,一次性帮助太多天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Softening up thousands at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.47,0:17:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就没法控制得到肉身的是哪些天使了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wasn't able to control what angels got let in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.89,0:17:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但用这种方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.00,0:17:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要Boyle还在那儿散播他的理论\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bartholomew's followers can jump in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.52,0:17:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bartholomew的追随者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just as soon as Bolye.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.39,0:17:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能轻而易举的找到肉身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still does this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.26,0:17:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说Red Dawg他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Red Dawg and his guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.54,0:17:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是Bartholomew的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were Bartholomew people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.75,0:17:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 他们本人早就被杀害了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, they got slaughtered.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.59,0:17:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,换句话说 现在的情况更糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means that this new group is even worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.01,0:17:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道天使们都是混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haven't I always said that angels are dicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.28,0:17:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常荣幸能有机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I so appreciate the opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.46,0:17:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,在圣经学习小组致辞\N{\fnArial\fs30}To address your bible study group.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.68,0:17:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我钦佩你们的热情 精力和投入\N{\fnArial\fs30}I admire your passion, your energy, your devotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.14,0:17:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫无疑问你们就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are exactly what God and his angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.36,0:17:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝和天使们心中的人选\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have in mind for the crusade.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.74,0:18:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 全体起立\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.37,0:18:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉起你们的双手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Join hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.59,0:18:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.05,0:18:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,感受从天堂传递出的无限爱意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feel the heavenly host reach out to embrace you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.11,0:18:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,并回赠你们的爱意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Embrace them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.48,0:18:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,天使们只想感受到你们的爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}The angels want nothing more than to feel your love.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.55,0:18:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎他们进驻你们的心灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome them into your hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.71,0:18:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let them in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.04,0:18:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,以Malachi之名\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the name of Malachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.00,0:18:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let them in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.42,0:18:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说 我一直都没有习惯他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frankly, I never got used to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.48,0:18:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在他们之中生活了千年之久\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lived among them for centuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.62,0:18:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不得不隐居起来才能保持神志清醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to isolate myself to keep sane.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.19,0:18:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类确实有混乱无序的一面 Metatron\N{\fnArial\fs30}Humans do seem chaotic, Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.43,0:19:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也让他们变得迷人 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which makes them fascinating, but.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.48,0:19:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些潮水般的情感 天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that emotion, geez.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.15,0:19:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有他们浪费掉的能力 真是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the wasted energy, it's just.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.95,0:19:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,让人心力交瘁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exhausting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.05,0:19:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.77,0:19:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sam Winchester\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.38,0:19:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直就是一团糟 更别提他的哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a mess in here, and the brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.71,0:19:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不知从何说起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not know where to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.21,0:19:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能让你脱离他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can free you from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.47,0:19:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论是人类还是天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}From all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.02,0:19:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想成为新天堂的主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You intend to be the ruler of this new heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.41,0:19:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.79,0:19:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是种责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a burdon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.75,0:19:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有义务承担\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel I must accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.06,0:19:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Metatron 这样你不就变成上帝了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metatron, but does that not make you God.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.45,0:19:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝只是个名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Semantics.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.02,0:19:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不觉得我能取代这个名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know that I'd take on that name.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.24,0:19:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Necessarily, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.36,0:20:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,当一切大功告成之时 可以叫我\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the time comes, we'll call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.14,0:20:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,X\N{\fnArial\fs30}X.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.15,0:20:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,X\N{\fnArial\fs30}X.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.43,0:20:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.93,0:20:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们能重建天堂 Gadriel\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can have paradise again, Gadriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.60,0:20:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.38,0:20:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对这一头的程序一点都不熟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm unfamiliar with this end of the process.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.06,0:20:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 有可能根本没有人在听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, no one may be listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.51,0:20:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我真的需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I do need assistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.75,0:20:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在遇到了一个死胡同\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have questions and there seem to be no answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.94,0:20:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不是走投无路\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't presume to ask for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.06,0:20:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会向你们祈祷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I weren't desperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.45,0:20:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我真的需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I need help.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.04,0:20:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我迷失了方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.78,0:20:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要你们的指引\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your guidance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.98,0:20:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.19,0:20:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,听听我的祈祷吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hear my prayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.12,0:20:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道人类是怎么做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how humans do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.23,0:21:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,试试插一下插头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try pluging it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.16,0:21:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然这并不是你想要的答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surely that wasn't the answer you were seeking.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.50,0:21:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.53,0:21:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Muriel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Muriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.51,0:21:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这衣服不是我自己选的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't pick the outfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.21,0:21:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.41,0:21:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 等等 请听我说完\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, wait, please just hear me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.23,0:21:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能让别人知道我在跟你说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can't be known that I even spoke to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.87,0:21:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只需要一点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.38,0:21:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.03,0:21:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.63,0:21:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想了解一下情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need information.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.96,0:21:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean 也许根本就没有解决的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, there may be nothing in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.95,0:21:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crowley说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley said.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.33,0:21:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个咒语是不可逆转的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The spell that cast down the angels was irreversible.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.20,0:21:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,先不管Crowley怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, screw Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.60,0:21:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么觉得他说的是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you think that anything he says is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.37,0:21:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些字句根本解读不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This part is nearly indecipherable.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.36,0:22:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像是Metatron本来就不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was like, when Metatron wrote it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.47,0:22:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,让人们读懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wanted to keep the word hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.95,0:22:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括先知\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even from prophets.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.52,0:22:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.48,0:22:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.74,0:22:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.85,0:22:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,又一起天使袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another angel attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.97,0:22:12.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, where.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.41,0:22:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,犹他州\N{\fnArial\fs30}Utah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.16,0:22:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,一所学院的圣经学习小组\N{\fnArial\fs30}A college bible study group.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.16,0:22:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,又一位高级别的教会女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}And their, guest speaker, some top-shelf church lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.36,0:22:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,尸体从内部烧焦 学生们的眼睛都消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Insides scorched out, kids' eyes were missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.24,0:22:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,但教会女士的眼睛还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not the church lady's.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.46,0:22:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说 她也是天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, she was an angel too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.41,0:22:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.25,0:22:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 她是教会欢乐合唱团的女高音\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she sang soprano for the, Melody Ministry glee club.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.39,0:22:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.88,0:22:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,唱诗班去表演时总是坐同一辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}The club goes to its gigs on a bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.13,0:22:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我问过了怀俄明警方\N{\fnArial\fs30}So when I checked with the Wyoming cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.12,0:22:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的目击证人声称 在找到尸体前\N{\fnArial\fs30}They said that the witness saw the same bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.65,0:22:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看见同一辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leaving the biker bar not long.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.85,0:22:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,从骑行者酒吧开过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before the bodies were found.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.22,0:22:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}So.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.18,0:22:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位教会女士跟两件案子都有关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Church lady angel was at both killings.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.05,0:22:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是她和她一起逃难的同伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm guessing that she and whoever she's running with.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.10,0:22:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,在酒吧里杀了Bartholomew的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killed Bartholomew's bikers at the bar and then.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.17,0:22:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后被Bartholomew的人找上门来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barth's boys hit her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.25,0:23:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在她招收新的皮囊的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When she's recruiting those students to be vessels.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.18,0:23:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 都是孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, a bunch of kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.63,0:23:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kevin\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.18,0:23:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间紧迫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clock's ticking.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.93,0:23:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,假设你说的都是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's say you're telling the truth that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.31,0:23:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Metatron真的骗了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metatron tricked you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.42,0:23:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是应该把你交出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should still turn you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.81,0:23:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.24,0:23:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这么肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.62,0:23:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.67,0:23:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你出于本能的信任我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you instinctively trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.13,0:23:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很相似\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're similar.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.50,0:23:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在那些激进的团体中保持中立\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both want no part of the fanatics.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.69,0:23:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你刚才祈祷的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when you prayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.37,0:23:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道来的不会是他们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know you wouldn't get one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.09,0:23:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能屏蔽他们的追踪 而且我没有荣光了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm warded and my grace's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.49,0:23:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我希望我看起来就像是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I was hoping that I would seem like just.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.01,0:23:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便一个绝望的人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another desperate human that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.27,0:23:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会引起那些激进团体的注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}That militants couldn't care less about.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.66,0:23:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我关心吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you think I care.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.01,0:23:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.53,0:23:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能会了解现在的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may know the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.05,0:23:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bartholomew他要血洗另一个团体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bartholomew, he's in a blood feud with another faction.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.69,0:23:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,太疯狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.52,0:23:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在谁在对抗他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who leads the opposition.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.77,0:23:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Malachi\N{\fnArial\fs30}Malachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.59,0:24:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Malachi\N{\fnArial\fs30}Malachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.72,0:24:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个无政府主义者\N{\fnArial\fs30}The anarchist.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.43,0:24:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在和Bartholomew平起平坐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has become equal with Bartholomew.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.71,0:24:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至更强\N{\fnArial\fs30}In some ways, worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.41,0:24:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是还是有你这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there are still those like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.30,0:24:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,想置身事外的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who want to stay out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.19,0:24:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,越来越少了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fewer and fewer.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.57,0:24:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,两方都想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each side is rounding up those.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.83,0:24:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉拢中立派\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who try and stay neutral.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.36,0:24:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,天使们会被折磨和杀害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angels are being tortured and killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.20,0:24:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不发誓效忠某一方的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they don't pledge loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.41,0:24:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,比我预想的还要糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's worse than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.89,0:24:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,两方都想消灭另一方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each side wants to crash the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.27,0:24:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,推翻Metatron的统治 称霸天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Overthrow Metatron and rule heaven and.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.17,0:24:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管谁掌管天堂 那都会是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heaven under either of them would be.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.45,0:24:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.46,0:24:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,意外收获啊 Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a bonus, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.30,0:24:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们本来是在跟踪Muriel\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're tracking Muriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.41,0:24:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是她这个没骨气的反抗者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cowardly holdout that she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.72,0:24:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,最神奇的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And wonder of wonders.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.07,0:24:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,她竟然带我们找到了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}She led us to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.06,0:24:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知情的情况下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not knowingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.18,0:25:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我修正一下 在不知情的情况下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I state corrected, not knowingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.80,0:25:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是愚蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stupidly.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.60,0:25:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我详细地解释一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Explain in detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.97,0:25:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道Metatron的咒语是怎么生效的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how Metatron's spell worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.72,0:25:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此 我无法协助你们逆转咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Therefore, I can't assist in reversing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.64,0:25:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个无辜的从犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was an unwitting accomplice.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.90,0:25:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,受骗者\N{\fnArial\fs30}A dupe.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.97,0:25:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,伟大的Castiel 被信任和重用的Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}The great Castiel, valued and trusted Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.05,0:25:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,精英中的精英 Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Top-of-the-Christmas-tree Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.61,0:25:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,也只是个受骗者\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more than a dupe.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.18,0:25:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是被骗还是策划者 你当时是参与者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dupe or mastermind you were inside the circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.19,0:25:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道Metatron的弱点是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know where Metatron's weakness lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.55,0:25:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.35,0:25:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.97,0:25:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Theo\N{\fnArial\fs30}Theo.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.96,0:25:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.54,0:26:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了你的信仰 你甘愿受苦 甚至牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd suffer, even die for your beliefs.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.19,0:26:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.06,0:26:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是是Metaron\N{\fnArial\fs30}But is Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.96,0:26:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的支持者数量已经大幅下降了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whose poll numbers have totally tanked.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.51,0:26:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,还值得你赔上性命吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worth your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.24,0:26:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,更重要的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}More importantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.87,0:26:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Metatron值得她赔命吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is Metatron worth her life.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.11,0:26:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.47,0:26:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 她是无辜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, she is innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.40,0:26:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别动她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You leave her alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.81,0:26:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没想碰她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no intentions on touching her.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.72,0:26:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,美德自身就是惩罚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Virtue is its own punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.40,0:26:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.87,0:26:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,天使 屠杀天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angels butchering angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.38,0:27:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经沦落至此了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this what we've become.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.59,0:27:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟随你的脚步而已 Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just following your example, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.26,0:27:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在天堂杀了多少天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many did you kill in heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.73,0:27:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他们坠落的时候又杀了多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many in the fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.00,0:27:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 你还不知道啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.58,0:27:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,无数的天使在坠落中死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}A host of angels died when they fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.54,0:27:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Azriel，Sophia\N{\fnArial\fs30}Azriel, Sophia.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.59,0:27:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ezekiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ezekiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.18,0:27:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不只是死去这么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Died doesn't even describe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.10,0:27:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,更像是毁灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Devastation.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.47,0:27:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,翅羽粉碎 无法言说的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wings shredded, unspeakable agony.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.12,0:27:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜你所赐\N{\fnArial\fs30}At your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.46,0:27:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.49,0:27:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该愿意提供所有你知道的信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would want to provide any information you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.90,0:27:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,考虑考虑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Considering.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.45,0:27:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.57,0:27:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把你交给拷问大师了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll leave you in the hands of the artist.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.66,0:27:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不在乎还剩下什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care what's left.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.52,0:27:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用祈求仁慈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't ask for mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.41,0:28:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有仁慈\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is none.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.41,0:28:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你最后一个机会结束这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give you one last chance for this to end.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.11,0:28:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我死个痛快吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a quick death.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.05,0:28:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你去和Metatron谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to speak to Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.96,0:28:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都知道你的影响力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone knows you have influence.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.42,0:28:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会听你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll listen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.25,0:28:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他带我重归天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask him to raise me to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.05,0:28:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能做到的 Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can do this, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.76,0:28:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会成为Metatron的战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be a soldier for Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.96,0:28:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,对他言听计从\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do anything he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.07,0:28:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 你不是效忠于Malachi吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, you serve Malachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.78,0:28:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本以为他能解决问题 结果发现他是个疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought he was the answer, but he's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.51,0:28:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 你现在才发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, are you, noticing this now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.20,0:28:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚才似乎很享受给他做苦力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are more than willing to do his dirty work.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.10,0:28:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不得不这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I doid what I had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.33,0:29:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你之前确信他能打败Bartholomew\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you were sure he would defeat Bartholomew.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.76,0:29:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是没人能逃过这场战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}But no one will survive this war.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.57,0:29:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你想去天堂旁观这一出闹剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you prefer to sit it out in heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.71,0:29:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以向他要求恢复你的荣光\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could talk to him about restoring your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.97,0:29:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's…it's ture.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.27,0:29:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Metatron和我有工作上的联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metatron and I do have a working relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.75,0:29:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.27,0:29:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很聪明 Theo\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're clever, Theo.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.45,0:29:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是盟友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.60,0:29:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也确实需要一名出色的战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he could use a skilled soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.17,0:29:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,像你这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.37,0:29:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.35,0:29:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很擅长团队协作 Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a team player, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.99,0:29:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.80,0:30:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要一点时间来联系他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll need a moment to make contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.60,0:30:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有我需要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you have something that I'll need.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.20,0:30:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.22,0:31:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.50,0:31:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 看到Sam了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, seen Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.92,0:31:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He went out.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.06,0:31:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.36,0:31:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.30,0:31:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你发现他最近总是这样玩消失了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You notice he's doing that a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.29,0:31:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.03,0:31:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean 时间紧迫 听好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I don't have a lot of time, so listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.29,0:31:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,反对派天使的领袖名叫Malachi\N{\fnArial\fs30}The leader of the opposition is an angel named Malachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.23,0:31:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.55,0:31:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他抓住了我 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had me, I.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.75,0:31:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被拷打了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was tortured.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.32,0:31:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我逃走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.76,0:32:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么逃走\N{\fnArial\fs30}How.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.36,0:32:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不得不这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…I did what I had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.17,0:32:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,变成跟他们一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Became what they've become.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.40,0:32:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,野蛮人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A barbarian.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.45,0:32:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什 Cass 你在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you…Cass, where are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.57,0:32:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是离开你们比较好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's better I stay away.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.96,0:32:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在他们更想要抓我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna want me even more now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.42,0:32:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm gonna be all right, I.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.49,0:32:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的荣光恢复了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got my grace back.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.43,0:32:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,本质上说不是我的荣光 不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, not mine per se, but.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.21,0:32:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,也有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.39,0:32:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你恢复了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, you…you're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.71,0:32:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你力量又回来了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got your mojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.12,0:32:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.74,0:32:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我现在是天使了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.99,0:32:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就没有犹豫一下什么的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're okay with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.44,0:32:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果要开战 我必须全面备战\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we're going to war, I need to be ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.29,0:32:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Cass - Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cass - Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.64,0:32:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.07,0:32:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.65,0:32:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是说一个叫Ezekiel的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't you say Sam was healed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.29,0:32:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,在帮Sam疗伤吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}By an angel named Ezekiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.08,0:32:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yeah, why.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.09,0:32:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ezekiel死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ezekiel is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.48,0:33:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 他在天使坠落的时候已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What - He died when the angels fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.63,0:33:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在就要咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need the spell ASAP.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.38,0:33:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,人人都说要咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone always needs a spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.75,0:33:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直都说现在就要\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's always ASAP.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.63,0:33:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.04,0:33:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,天使不能被其他人驱逐\N{\fnArial\fs30}An angel can't be expelled by another human.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.11,0:33:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能被宿主驱逐 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only by the host, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.23,0:33:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是如果 有方法能减弱天使的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what if, there's a way to power down the angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.35,0:33:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,短时间内无法恢复\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that it wasn't in charge for a few seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.45,0:33:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 例如\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What - For instant, if.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.17,0:33:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,假设我想要跟他的肉身本人说话 但\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hypothetically, I want to speak with the vessel, but.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.61,0:33:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不想让寄住在肉身里的天使听到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not had the squatter listen in.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.20,0:33:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.43,0:33:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 Kevin\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.55,0:33:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在有这么多被附身的人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got tons of possessed humans out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.39,0:33:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.60,0:33:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,当天使们互相残杀的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when the angels kill each other off.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.09,0:33:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为宿主的人类才是最大的受害者\N{\fnArial\fs30}The humans are taking it in the teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.96,0:33:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以如果我想提供信息给肉身本人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what if I wanted to clue a human in.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.61,0:33:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他或她把天使赶出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that he or she could spit the angel out.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.54,0:33:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一件好事 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would be a good thing, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.30,0:33:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吧 - 行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uh, yeah - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.20,0:33:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始翻译石板 行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, hit the tablet.Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.16,0:33:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在吗 - 昨天 灰姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now? - Yesterday, Cinderella.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.86,0:34:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Metatron 我一直在考虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been thinking this over, Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.83,0:34:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会加入你作为副手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll join you at second in command.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.13,0:34:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常好 Gadriel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bravo, Gadriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.05,0:34:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,此次行动将会抹去诸世纪来\N{\fnArial\fs30}This move will erase the mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.38,0:34:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你倍受鄙视的罪名\N{\fnArial\fs30}That has hounded you through the centuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.34,0:34:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,天堂会恢复\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heaven will be restored.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.08,0:34:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也会变成最受人尊敬的英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}As will your reputation as one of its greatest heroes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.59,0:34:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢你给我这次机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thank you for this opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.65,0:34:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但还有一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's just one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.64,0:34:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.77,0:34:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须确认你是忠诚于我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to be sure of your fidelity.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.16,0:34:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经向你示忠了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.71,0:34:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我是要非常确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I mean really sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.27,0:34:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have enemies who pose.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.07,0:34:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能威胁到我们行动的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}An imminent threat to our effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.09,0:34:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们必须被中和掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}They must be neutralized.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.81,0:35:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀死他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slain.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.14,0:35:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.28,0:35:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是我的作风\N{\fnArial\fs30}That…that is not who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.52,0:35:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 这是你任务清单上的第一个名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, here's the first name on your to-do list.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.76,0:35:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候作出决定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.31,0:35:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们刚才画的那玩意儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so this masterpiece we just painted.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.66,0:35:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,会起作用的 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna work, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.20,0:35:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个符咒应该\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sigils're supposed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.19,0:35:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以削弱天使的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Briefly hobble the possessing angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.65,0:35:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果消息准确的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the info is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.78,0:35:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, what.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.92,0:35:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间太短了 我从石板上找到的信息很有限\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only had time to get a little from tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.08,0:35:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩下的是从学者的古籍上找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rest came from the old Men of Letters' book.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.61,0:35:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你的血触碰到那个符咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as your blood touches the ignition sigil.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.95,0:35:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,咒语就能起作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}The spell kicks in.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.55,0:36:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean 发生什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.19,0:36:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都跟你说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.61,0:36:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,理论上你是告诉我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told me theoretically.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.41,0:36:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean 我们在储藏室里画了符咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, we just painted sigils in the storeroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.37,0:36:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.07,0:36:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须相信我 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to trust me, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.70,0:36:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把我能透露的都告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust that I told you everything that I can for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.45,0:36:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,做得到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.60,0:36:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直都相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.24,0:36:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是每一次都搞砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It always ends up screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.00,0:36:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 每一次吗 不是每一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, always, not always.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.43,0:36:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, where have you been.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.52,0:36:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,买啤酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, beer run.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.62,0:36:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,去好久啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long beer run.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.22,0:36:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,能聊聊吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.06,0:36:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.33,0:36:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是有什么重要的事儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This sounds serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.36,0:36:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.43,0:36:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.39,0:36:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有那么多时间解释了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to tell you some stuff fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.47,0:37:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听了会很生气的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna piss you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.21,0:37:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.71,0:37:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些试炼真的让你状况很糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those trials really messed you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.10,0:37:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 我知道 - 不 你不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, I know that - No, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.49,0:37:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的状态糟糕是差点死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean messed you up like almost dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.74,0:37:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不再有生日 尘归尘\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more birthdays, dust to dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.04,0:37:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能看着你死去 所以我做了一次决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}That messed me up, so I made a move, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.31,0:37:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在没有跟你商量的情况下 做了艰难的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}A tough move about you without talking it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.48,0:37:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为当时你处于昏迷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you were at a coma.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.26,0:37:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 什么时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?When.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.18,0:37:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在医院里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were in the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.66,0:37:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说你快要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, they said you were going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.48,0:37:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.89,0:37:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让天使附身\N{\fnArial\fs30}I let an angel in.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.91,0:37:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,在谁身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}In what.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.99,0:37:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}In you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.22,0:37:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他能够治愈你 他确实做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he can heal you and he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.12,0:37:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在还在我身上吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's still in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.29,0:37:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 不可能的 Dean 这不可能发生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, it's impossible, Dean.That couldn't happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.82,0:37:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从未邀请他附我身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never invited him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.78,0:37:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我骗你让你说了愿意 Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tricked you into saying yes, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.09,0:37:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是唯一的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seemed like the only way.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.86,0:37:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,又这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, again.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.28,0:38:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为我无法处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}You thought I couldn't handle something.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.05,0:38:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以你就自作主张 - 我不得不这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So you took over - No, I did what I have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.29,0:38:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不会答应这样做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would've never agreed to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.39,0:38:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且你会死去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you would've died.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.70,0:38:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者至少让我选择一下也好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or maybe I would've liked the choice at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.11,0:38:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚一点我们再讨论这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can do this later.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.94,0:38:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想怎么打我都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, you can kick my ass all you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.68,0:38:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们有更严重的问题要解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now we got bigger problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.78,0:38:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,严重的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.57,0:38:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那天使说谎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The angel lied to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.58,0:38:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是他口中的那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, he's not who he said he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.06,0:38:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他的名字叫Ezekiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said his name was Ezekiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.01,0:38:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,据Cass说的 他是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool guy according to Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.56,0:38:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他不是Ezekiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he's not Ezekiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.44,0:38:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then who is he.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.38,0:38:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don's know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.43,0:38:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然Ezekiel已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently Ezekiel is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.18,0:38:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管他是谁 只要他愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever this guy is can end you in a heartbeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.56,0:38:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可以随时要你的命 你必须驱逐他\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he wants to, so you've got to dump him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.47,0:38:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到我所说的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you hearing what I'm saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.93,0:38:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你现在已经恢复得差不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you're well enough now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.95,0:38:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你现在必须驱逐他\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you got to expel him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.20,0:38:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sam Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.21,0:38:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.02,0:39:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.85,0:39:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有察觉到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, do you notice anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.10,0:39:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近Dean有些反常吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little bit off about Dean lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.36,0:39:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,私下说 我有点担心他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Between you and me, I'm a little bit worried about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.62,0:39:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用担心Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.30,0:39:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.82,0:39:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.94,0:39:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 Kevin\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.27,0:39:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.11,0:39:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sam已经不在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no more Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.63,0:39:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我觉得我掩饰得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I played him convincingly I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.92,0:39:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.17,0:39:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚我听到你跟Kevin Tran的对话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard you talked with Kevin Tran tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.56,0:39:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,理论上你是告诉我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told me theoretically.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.21,0:39:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean 我们在储藏室里画了符咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, we just painted sigil in the storeroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.32,0:40:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.57,0:40:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须相信我 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to trust me, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.98,0:40:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把我能透露的都告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust that I told you everything that I can for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.57,0:40:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,做得到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.37,0:40:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要改动了符咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alter a sigil.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.48,0:40:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪怕只有一点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even the slightest.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.57,0:40:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能改变咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alter the spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.06,0:40:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于Kevin 我感到抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.71,0:40:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,但终归\N{\fnArial\fs30}But ultimately.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.14,0:40:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这么做的出发点是好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.94,0:40:33.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不得不这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did what I had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.67,0:41:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kevin\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.09,0:41:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kevin\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin.
